WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:08.500
The court aristocrats are intoxicated by southern luxuries; none wish to see our armies march north.

00:09.000 --> 00:16.500
Yet if we do not reclaim our lost northern homeland, Great Xuan will eventually wither away in this southern corner.

00:17.000 --> 00:24.000
Tonight, the Emperor will gauge the temper of every commander and prince. We must remain poised, firm, and unyielding.
